Inputs:

PPG analog signal
second PPG signal
ADC sampling data
Possibly battery/power status
user calibration coefficients

Processing:

ADC acquisition
Filtering
Signal conditioning
Heartbeat/peak detection
PPG timing detection
PTT calculation
BP estimation
Signal-quality checking

Outputs:

Systolic BP
Diastolic BP
PTT
Heart rate
Signal-quality/error status
Possibly raw/processed waveform data for debugging

Milestone 1

Generate/sample an artificial PPG waveform.

Milestone 2

Detect heartbeats from it.

Milestone 3

Sample an artificial PPG + PPG pair.

Milestone 4

Calculate PTT from those signals.

Milestone 5

Do it with actual sensors.

Milestone 6

Handle motion/noise.

Milestone 7

Map PTT → BP.
